# openOODA / ooda

**Pin:** `v0.204.0-beta`

Product compiler and CLI for the OODA language (`.oo`). Permanent product path is **pure native Backend-C** (`ooda run` / `ooda build --target c` + CHS runtime). No Cargo/Rust product build.

## Docs & residual truth

| Surface | Where |
|--------|--------|
| Website / install | https://openOODA.github.io |
| Progress vs NORTHSTAR (residual truth) | [openOODA/openOODA/ROADMAP.oot](https://github.com/openOODA/openOODA/blob/main/ROADMAP.oot) |
| Residual truth | `../openOODA/SHIPPED.oot` and `../openOODA/ROADMAP.oot` |
| Alpha / not-beta | Beta is not claimed. Owner tags beta. |
| Release pin | `install/BOOTSTRAP_PIN` |

**What's real (alpha, honest):** Backend-C build+exec; capability free-call seal + process-local magic-token re-check; simple `requires` / path-A `verify`; ARC retain/release with free-on-ref0 on smoke paths; `--json-errors` structured diagnostics + fix hints.

**Residual (not claimed product):** interactive web playground eval; full 0ms GC / leak-free reclaim (self-host UAF residual); JIT interpreter; LLVM as release product path (emit smoke only); full contract/`ensures` proof; one-turn AI auto-fixing via AST patches; beta readiness.

Do not treat this README as a second residual table — **ROADMAP.oot is the residual source of truth**.

## Quickstart

```bash
git clone https://github.com/openOODA/ooda
cd ooda
OODAC_BIN=./bootstrap/seed/oodac bash bootstrap/oodac_pure_build oodac/main.oo oodac/oodac
OODA_FS_WRITEDIR="$HOME" OODA_CHECKOUT="$PWD" ooda install
. ~/.config/ooda/env
```
